Utilities — water, energy and the services that sustain other work (@utilities: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @hephaestus, #making-and-maintenance "water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN") { r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX
Understand the water, energy and supporting services that make households, laboratories and production facilities work over time.

[Water, sanitation and industrial utilities — from sources to continuing service](water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN) follows sources, quality, treatment, delivery, sanitation, industrial use and continuing operation. [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../engineering/electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ) develops electrical service, while [Fluid dynamics — motion, forces, transport and evidence](../physics/fluid-dynamics/Fluid-dynamics.lingua#r_7PQW1WDHK708BFV23MD8ET61VZ) supplies the shared account of fluid motion and physical evidence.

Follow the dependencies, people, measurements, spare parts and maintenance that keep a service available. Related work continues through [Hephaestus](../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../../gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH) and [Philosophy](../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

[Development scope: Energy and utilities](../../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_376AMKFFG2BY4E8T2A5Y923HV4).
